Hi all! I'm really amazed by all the feedback I've received during the
development of vlajipno. I'm really glad to say that the current fully
redesigned version is now comfortable to use as a daily text reader. Here
are the new features:

   - Fully redesigned as a daily text reader.
   - Mobile support
   - Markdown support
   - Improved response time

There are still important features waiting to be added such as fu'ivla and
lujvo support and standalone javascript plugin, but I would be glad if you
can have a try and give me some feedback.

The website is still at: http://vlajipno.sorpaas.com

Brendan


